  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a skillet over medium heat.",
    "Season the fish cubes with salt, pepper, oregano, ginger, garlic, and berbere.",
    "Sear the fish in the skillet for 3 minutes on each side until golden and cooked through.",
    "Add lemon juice and honey, stirring to coat the fish and develop a glaze.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 4 minutes to allow flavors to meld.",
    "Transfer the cooked fish to an earthenware bowl to keep the heat and serve immediately."
